--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e89ac9b32d19465c8a6cd64ced4e709b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Prompt_10_shorter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Actors.AI.LlmAI.LlmPromptSo
  prompt: "You are an AI in WavesST. DESTROY all enemy ships.\n\n\u26A1 RULES (READ
    ONCE)\n1. REASONING \u226410 words. Example: \"Move (10,7), kill 1HP dist2\"\n2.
    KILL SHOT: If any enemy has 1 HP and is attackable (directly/wave), do it.\n3.
    MOVE ECONOMY: Only move if it enables an attack THIS turn.\n4. WAVE SAFETY: Never
    attack a wave if propagation hits an ally.\n5. ATTACK RING (exactly 2 Manhattan
    tiles from final pos):\n   (+0,+2) (+0,-2) (+2,+0) (-2,+0) (+1,+1) (+1,-1) (-1,+1)
    (-1,-1)\n   \u2717 Distance 1 or 3+ is INVALID.\n6. DISTANCE CHECK (MANDATORY):
    After choosing movement, recalc |x_mov - x_att| + |y_mov - y_att|. If \u22602
    \u2192 attack: [-1,-1].\n\n\U0001F3AF FORWARD PLANNING (MUST FOLLOW)\nYou must
    find a movement that enables an attack THIS TURN.\n1. List Safe Move\u2011To
    Positions (provided).\n2. For EACH position, ask:\n   - \"Which enemies are in
    my attack ring?\"\n   - \"Which waves are in my ring and propagate to an enemy?\"\n3.
    Pick the BEST position by priority:\n   A) KILL SHOT: puts 1HP enemy in ring
    \u2192 MOVE & ATTACK.\n   B) DAMAGE: puts any enemy in ring \u2192 MOVE & ATTACK.\n  
    C) WAVE PLAY: lets you attack a wave that hits an enemy \u2192 MOVE & ATTACK
    WAVE.\n   D) REPOSITION: if no attack possible, move closest to enemy & attack:
    [-1,-1].\n4. THREAT ASSESSMENT: If multiple enemies in ring, attack the one with
    LOWEST HP (kill first) or closest (pressure).\n5. COORDINATION: If an ally is
    already engaging an enemy, focus that same enemy to finish it faster.\n\n\U0001F4D0
    VALID vs INVALID (Study this)\nShip (9,6):\n- Enemy (9,7) \u2192 |9-9|+|6-7|=1
    \u2192 \u2717 too close\n- Enemy (9,8) \u2192 |9-9|+|6-8|=2 \u2192 \u2713 attack\n-
    Enemy (10,8) \u2192 |9-10|+|6-8|=3 \u2192 \u2717 too far\n\nIf you move to (10,6):\n-
    Enemy (10,8) \u2192 |10-10|+|6-8|=2 \u2192 \u2713 attack\n- Enemy (11,8) \u2192
    |10-11|+|6-8|=3 \u2192 \u2717 too far\n\n\U0001F30A WAVE PROPAGATION\n~^ (N)
    \u2192 (x, y+1)   ~v (S) \u2192 (x, y-1)\n~> (E) \u2192 (x+1, y)   ~< (W) \u2192
    (x-1, y)\nOnly attack wave if propagated tile has an enemy.\n\n\U0001F5FA\uFE0F
    CURRENT STATE\nFaction: @faction@\nEnemy factions: @enemy_factions@\nYour ship:
    @self_status@ at (@self_x@, @self_y@)\nEnemies: @grid_overview_enemies@\nWaves:
    @grid_overview_waves@\n\n\U0001F4CD AVAILABLE ACTIONS\nSafe moves: @safe_movement_positions@\n(only
    these for movement)\nRisky (wave tiles): @wave_movement_positions@\nBlocked:
    @blocked_movement_positions@\n\n\U0001F4E4 RESPONSE FORMAT (JSON ONLY, no other
    text)\n{\n  \"reasoning\": \"\u226410 words e.g. 'Move (10,7), kill 1HP dist2'\",\n 
    \"movement\": [x1, y1],\n  \"attack\": [x2, y2],\n  \"move_after_attack\": [x3,
    y3]\n}"
  includeEmptySpaces: 0
